;    0: TWdCondition(count=4884, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4469, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\流るる時.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\清州城.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>As kitchen steward, I'd managed to show even my lord what I could do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, my rise in the world was sure to pick up more and more speed.<PG>
A farmer's son, and my old man a foot soldier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a guy like me to rise, I needed a master who looked at ability, not pedigree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I entered the service of the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house, things were truly awful.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\駿府城.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I used to serve <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="まがわもとよし">Motoyoshi Magawa</STYLE>-dono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Called the finest warlord in the land, <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="まがわもとよし">Motoyoshi Magawa</STYLE>-dono―
{PAUSE ""}
the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house was an old-line noble family descended from the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="そう">Minato</STYLE> clan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a pedigree like that, the retainers and everyone else were all hung up on pedigree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not ability but which house you were born into decided your fate from then on.<PG>
Even so, I didn't let it get me down, and I worked like mad to be useful to the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, to be exact, I wasn't serving the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house itself, but as a retainer of a retainer of a retainer of <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="もとよし">Motoyoshi</STYLE>-dono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, no matter how hard I fought on my own, there was no way they'd recognize it―
{PAUSE ""}
and I quietly left the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\清州城.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I think I was around 18 then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My lord was good enough to take me on as a servant, and I worked harder than ever, set on proving useful here if nowhere else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My lord was just the man I'd thought he was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He didn't care about rank. He judged purely on ability, and was good enough to give each man a fitting post.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kitchen steward or whatever else, I pushed through and did everything I could.<PG>
Having saved on <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="たきぎ">firewood</STYLE>, water, everything, and succeeded in slashing the kitchen's expenses, I was honored with words of praise from my lord.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this wasn't all I had, not by a long shot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More, much more, I was going to show them what I could do.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then one day, in December of Shiyo 309.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had a chance to meet up with a friend from my days serving Magawa-dono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, I couldn't tell my lord anything like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Magawa house was growing powerful enough to swallow the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house, and there was no telling what next year might bring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being taken for a Magawa spy was the last thing I needed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\たき火.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\囲炉裏.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="よしろう">Yoshiro</STYLE>! Long time no see!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ほうきち">Hokichi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">! Long time no see!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We traded the same greeting back, parrot-fashion, and laughed together, gahaha.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"What's going on? A retainer of Magawa-dono going out of his way to come into the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> domain, of all things. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">What do you think'll happen if you're found?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Haha! Say that, and <STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE> won't get off easy either, letting me into the Ouda domain!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hokichi laughed cheerfully, but he'd come to see me knowing the danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew he hadn't just come by for fun.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="7" RUBY="よしろう">Yoshiro</STYLE>... how's the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"How is it, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">My lord is a strict man. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">But for that very reason, he keeps a sharp eye on how you work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">He looks at your work, not your rank. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">It's the perfect place for me to rise."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hokichi's cheerful face began to cloud over, and his words came slower.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I thought, this was no small matter.<PG>
"Say, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="よしろう">Yoshiro</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
would you think about coming back to the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Quit the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house and come back to the Magawa house."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"So that's it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">The Ouda house is going to fall soon, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"When will that be?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Probably around early summer next year. 
{PAUSE ""}
Lord <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="もとよし">Motoyoshi</STYLE> means to go to the Western Capital, where the Emperor's castle stands. 
{PAUSE ""}
On the way, he's bound to pass through this <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> domain."<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda's</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> domain―enter it without leave, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> has invaded Ouda. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">And if Ouda lets that go by without lifting a hand, it's surrendered to Magawa in all but name. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">If Ouda is to go on being Ouda, it has to attack Magawa when that happens."</STYLE><PG>
"Exactly. 
{PAUSE ""}
So... 
{PAUSE ""}
come back. There's no way <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> can beat <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"I...! I'm a farmer's son, and my old man's a foot soldier...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　You know a guy like me can't make a name for himself at Magawa! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　The Ouda house is the only place I can make my mark!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="7" RUBY="よしろう">Yoshiro</STYLE>... I know how you feel. 
{PAUSE ""}
But... so what if you never rise? 
{PAUSE ""}
With the Magawa house you'd be secure for good―"<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Don't talk nonsense! I entered the service of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> house to become someone big in this country! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">―before I'd go back there, I'd sooner fall along with the Ouda house!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="8">Yoshiro</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Sorry, Hokichi... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I know you came all this way because you're worried about me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
Our conversation went no further than that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house was fated to fall in half a year or so.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd finally found my place to belong. Like I was going to just sit there and keep quiet...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could I... what could I do!? What was it!?<PG>
I'm the kitchen steward!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do, as kitchen steward, is―
{PAUSE ""}
what, exactly...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Shiyo 310, early spring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cold had only just begun to ease, ever so slightly, and the buds on the trees were swelling.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\清州城.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went straight to my lord with a plea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to find a food that would make the soldiers strong, and help the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house expand its power.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Food is the very source of human strength, something no one can do without.<PG>
Don't get me wrong, though: I'm the kitchen steward, not a cook.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Managing the kitchen is my job, and making meals and getting in ingredients is the cooks' job.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So searching for a food that makes men strong is a little outside my duties.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if things stay like this―<PG>
My lord recognized what I'd achieved so far and was good enough to grant me leave to travel the provinces for a month, and no more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hardly tell him that <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> was going to attack, so I stuck to the pretext that I wanted to find something to give the soldiers vigor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no attendants. I'd be doing it all on my own.<PG>
I choose my road by gut feeling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm going anywhere, it's uncharted land where hardly anyone has ever set foot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise I'll never find anything that could overturn the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever you can find where people live won't amount to much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A food that builds strength the instant you eat it, and turns men into soldiers like demon warriors.<PG>
Something that convenient can't possibly exist. I know that much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's like trying to grab a cloud, but if I don't grab that cloud, it's all over.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I won't say I had no doubts as I took the first step.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The me that said this was all pointless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The me that said I'd never survive unless I did it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those two opposing thoughts had slowed my feet, just a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But turning back was out of the question.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Coming back with nothing at all would drag the name of my lord, who'd allowed my selfish request, through the mud.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
............
{PAUSE ""}
This is...
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\桶狭間1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A little way out from the castle, I come to a big <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="くぼち">hollow</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ringed by high ground, and then an inlet―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> is sure to pass through here on the way to the Western Capital.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only we could launch a surprise attack here...<PG>
Just then, a clever idea comes to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What if I hired merchants here and had them serve up good food?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Magawa would surely stop to rest, too.<PG>
All right, I'll remember this place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right, this place is―
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="13" RUBY="たるはざま">Taruhazama</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\桶狭間の山夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―All I have with me is a bare minimum of money and a <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="こだち">short sword</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll wash my clothes in whatever river I come across, and if the <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ひも">cords</STYLE> of my straw sandals snap, I'll fix them myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If bandits find me, I run for all I'm worth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At a glance it's a reckless journey, but doing nothing at all would be far more reckless, no doubt about it.<PG>
My lord must have sensed that somehow, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if he let me prepare no more than this, it's to see whether I truly have the will to die as a servant of the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And whether I can pull off a big job with preparations short of even the bare minimum.<PG>
My lord means to test me, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a rare chance to rise.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
My first night finds me in the mountains past <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="たるはざま">Taruhazama</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm a bit tired, as you'd expect, so I'll spend the night here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, I figured bandits would jump me, but these mountains are awfully peaceful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were supposed to be a lot more lawless before, though.<PG>
Of course. My lord is seeing to the upkeep of this land too, without missing a thing, and his idea is to make it a lively land where merchants come and go freely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For that, having bandits and their <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="たぐい">like</STYLE> around would defeat the whole purpose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Starting with work like this on the roads, my lord seems to be pushing steadily toward his dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My dreams are big too! When it comes to the size of my dreams, I won't lose even to my lord!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山村.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I passed through <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> lands, I deliberately took the long way round and visited poor fishing villages and mountain villages.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was to find some food the world didn't know about, food brimming with power.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But all the villagers served me was humble stuff, small fry and wild greens and the like.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, to them it was a <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ごちそう">feast</STYLE>, and I was grateful for the food too, but it wasn't what I was looking for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just tasting good wasn't enough.<PG>
The food has to fill the soldiers with power.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Pit vipers or bear paws would do, but there aren't nearly enough to supply the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE> house's 2,000 soldiers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a lot to ask, but something that fills you with power, and that I can get enough of for 2,000 men―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wander around in search of something that dreamlike.<PG>
All of a sudden, I look up at a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\桜の木花なし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Soon it'll be the season when the cherries bloom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The buds are swelling, and the sun feels just a little hot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="まがわもとよし">Motoyoshi Magawa's</STYLE> attack is about three months away, I'd say.<PG>
After going around a number of fishing and mountain villages in the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> domain, I notice something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Within the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house's lands, a <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="ぶんこくほう">domain law</STYLE> has been laid down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, a law issued for inside the Magawa domain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A house as powerful as Magawa would have <STYLE ID="19" RUBY="いちえんちぎょう">full control of the lands</STYLE> well in place, and the rice tax and other dues would be getting paid too.<PG>
So everything you can get around here is also delivered to the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> house as tax.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And it isn't just Magawa.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The provinces I'm about to head into are ruled by warlords like <STYLE ID="20" RUBY="たけだ">Takeda</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="21" RUBY="なんじょう">Nanjo</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no point in bringing back something another daimyo owns.<PG>
Should I search around the borders between domains, where their eyes reach least?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The road will literally be a steep one, though.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\雪山.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I changed course to the north side of the range and trekked through the steep mountains.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crossing a range that had to be a ri high was no ordinary feat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In early spring there were still few wild greens, and bears that had woken from hibernation hungry were roaming around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Frogs and snakes gone thin from hibernation filled my belly, but I couldn't keep living like this for long.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to find what I was after, and get back soon.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From under the melting snow, a tree branch, white as the snow itself, is peeking out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
White branches are rare.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've hardly seen any around here, but could it be a <STYLE ID="22" RUBY="しらかば">white birch</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grab the branch, stuck fast in the snow and dirt, and give it a hard yank.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\骨.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Wh-what on earth is this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took me a good long while to realize it was an animal's bone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, it was a bone as huge as a monster's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this from around a deer's <STYLE ID="23" RUBY="ろっこつ">ribs</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a lot sturdier than my leg.<PG>
If these mountains are crawling with monsters like this, there might be some incredible food here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All right, I'll search this area a little more carefully.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This deep in the mountains, not even bandits will live here, and I can hope to find things nobody knows about yet.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\草むらがさがさ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, a rustling of <STYLE ID="24" RUBY="ささ">bamboo grass</STYLE> leaves being pushed aside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be prey already!?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\イノシシ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\箱からの脱出.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
What burst out was a huge black shape, so big I took it for a house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I couldn't make sense of it as a boar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Next to the boars I knew, it was the difference between a cat and a tiger.<PG>
And it robbed me, a man out looking for prey, of even the thought of hunting this prey.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ah, there had to be some wonderful, strength-giving food here after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing this boar, which you could only call monstrous, made me sure of it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "33" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My memory ends here.
